{"content":"\u003c!-- wp:html --\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n  .bs-page * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  .bs-page {\n    font-family: \u0027Inter\u0027, \u0027Segoe UI\u0027, Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: #0d1117;\n    color: #f0f0f0;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  /* NAV */\n  .bs-nav-wrap {\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 1000;\n    background: rgba(10,14,22,0.97);\n    border-top: 2px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.6);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.2);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .bs-nav {\n    padding: 18px 48px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .bs-nav-logo img { height: 84px; width: auto; display: block; }\n  .bs-nav-links { display: flex; gap: 40px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  .bs-nav-links a { color: #e8e8e8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.4px; transition: color 0.2s; }\n  .bs-nav-links a:hover { color: #c4a050; }\n\n  /* HERO */\n  .bs-hero {\n    min-height: 88vh;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 40px 24px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d1117 0%, #111827 60%, #0d1117 100%);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .bs-hero::before {\n    content: \u0027\u0027;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 50%, rgba(196,160,80,0.07) 0%, transparent 60%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .bs-hero-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 64px;\n    align-items: center;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 100%;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .bs-hero-inner { position: relative; }\n  .bs-hero-eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #c4a050;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.4);\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n  }\n  .bs-hero h1 {\n    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    color: #fff;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .bs-hero h1 span { color: #c4a050; }\n  .bs-hero-sub {\n    font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 18px);\n    color: #aaa;\n    margin-bottom: 36px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    max-width: 480px;\n  }\n  .bs-btn-group { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .bs-hero-photo { position: relative; }\n  .bs-hero-photo img {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 280px;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 0 1px rgba(196,160,80,0.15);\n    display: block;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .bs-hero-photo-stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }\n  .bs-hero-photo-desk { max-width: 360px; width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; opacity: 0.85; box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(196,160,80,0.1); display: block; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .bs-hero-photo::before {\n    content: \u0027\u0027;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -20px; right: -20px;\n    width: 200px; height: 200px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(196,160,80,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .bs-hero-stats {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 32px;\n    margin-top: 36px;\n    padding-top: 32px;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n  }\n  .bs-hero-stat-num { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #c4a050; display: block; }\n  .bs-hero-stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 2px; display: block; }\n  .bs-btn-primary {\n    background: #c4a050;\n    color: #0d1117;\n    padding: 14px 32px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .bs-btn-primary:hover { background: #d4b060; transform: translateY(-2px); }\n  .bs-btn-secondary {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.5);\n    color: #c4a050;\n    padding: 14px 32px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .bs-btn-secondary:hover { border-color: #c4a050; transform: translateY(-2px); }\n\n  /* SECTION BASE */\n  .bs-section { padding: 96px 24px; }\n  .bs-section-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .bs-section-alt { background: #111827; }\n  .bs-section-label {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #c4a050;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .bs-section h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #fff;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .bs-section-intro {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #aaa;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin-bottom: 56px;\n  }\n\n  /* HERO DOT GRID */\n  .bs-hero-dots {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(196,160,80,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 36px 36px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  /* SECTION DIVIDER */\n  .bs-divider {\n    height: 1px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(196,160,80,0.3) 40%, rgba(196,160,80,0.3) 60%, transparent 100%);\n  }\n\n  /* PROGRAM CARD COVER */\n  .bs-program-cover { height: 260px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #0f1520; }\n  .bs-program-cover svg { opacity: 0.9; filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)); }\n  .bs-program-cover img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block; }\n  .bs-program-cover.bs-cover-innercode { background: #160a2a; }\n  .bs-cover-partner { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1608 0%, #2e2510 50%, #1a1608 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.3); }\n  .bs-cover-soon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111318 0%, #1c2030 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.15); }\n  .bs-cover-auto { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1318 0%, #1a2030 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.2); }\n  .bs-program-body { padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }\n\n  /* CREDENTIAL STRIP */\n  .bs-cred-strip { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }\n  .bs-cred-item {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    background: rgba(196,160,80,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.15);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n  }\n  .bs-cred-num { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; color: #c4a050; min-width: 54px; }\n  .bs-cred-text { font-size: 14px; color: #bbb; line-height: 1.4; }\n\n  /* AFFILIATE CHECKLIST */\n  .bs-check-list { list-style: none; margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }\n  .bs-check-list li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; font-size: 15px; color: #ccc; line-height: 1.5; }\n  .bs-check-icon { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }\n\n  /* ÜBER MICH */\n  .bs-about-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 64px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .bs-about-text p { color: #bbb; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 16px; }\n  .bs-about-text p strong { color: #fff; }\n  .bs-about-tags { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 24px; }\n  .bs-tag {\n    background: rgba(196,160,80,0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.3);\n    color: #c4a050;\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .bs-about-quote {\n    border-left: 3px solid #c4a050;\n    padding: 32px 40px;\n    background: rgba(196,160,80,0.05);\n    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n  }\n  .bs-about-quote blockquote {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #ddd;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .bs-about-quote cite { font-size: 13px; color: #888; }\n\n  /* DREI SÄULEN */\n  .bs-pillars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }\n  .bs-pillar {\n    background: #161d2a;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 40px 32px;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;\n  }\n  .bs-pillar:hover { border-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.4); transform: translateY(-4px); }\n  .bs-pillar-icon {\n    width: 68px;\n    height: 68px;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    background: rgba(196,160,80,0.07);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.25);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 28px;\n    transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;\n  }\n  .bs-pillar:hover .bs-pillar-icon {\n    background: rgba(196,160,80,0.12);\n    border-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.45);\n  }\n  .bs-pillar h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .bs-pillar p { font-size: 15px; color: #999; line-height: 1.7; }\n\n  /* DREIKLANG */\n  .bs-funnel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0; position: relative; }\n  .bs-funnel::before {\n    content: \u0027\u0027;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 60px;\n    left: 17%;\n    right: 17%;\n    height: 2px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(196,160,80,0.3), rgba(196,160,80,0.6), rgba(196,160,80,0.3));\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .bs-funnel-step {\n    background: #161d2a;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 40px 28px;\n    text-align: center;\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 0 8px;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s;\n  }\n  .bs-funnel-step:hover { border-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.4); }\n  .bs-funnel-number {\n    width: 56px;\n    height: 56px;\n    background: #c4a050;\n    color: #0d1117;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    margin: 0 auto 20px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .bs-funnel-badge {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #c4a050;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .bs-funnel-step h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .bs-funnel-step p { font-size: 14px; color: #999; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .bs-funnel-step .bs-btn-primary { font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 20px; }\n  .bs-funnel-step:first-child { border-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.3); }\n  .bs-funnel-step:first-child .bs-funnel-badge::before { content: \u0027✦ \u0027; }\n\n  /* PROGRAMME */\n  .bs-programs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }\n  .bs-program-card { background: #161d2a; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .bs-program-card:hover { border-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.3); transform: translateY(-3px); }\n  .bs-program-card.coming-soon { opacity: 0.65; }\n  .bs-program-card.featured { border-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.55); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(196,160,80,0.15), 0 20px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }\n  .bs-program-card.featured:hover { border-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.8); transform: translateY(-4px); }\n  .bs-program-badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .bs-badge-free, .bs-badge-entry, .bs-badge-top, .bs-badge-partner, .bs-badge-new { background: rgba(196,160,80,0.1); color: #c4a050; border: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.4); }\n  .bs-badge-soon { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); color: #666; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }\n  .bs-program-body h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .bs-program-body p { font-size: 14px; color: #888; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n  .bs-coming-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #666; border: 1px solid #333; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; display: inline-block; }\n  .bs-program-link { font-size: 13px; color: #c4a050; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: gap 0.2s; }\n  .bs-program-link:hover { gap: 10px; }\n\n  /* ATMOSPHERIC BANNER */\n  .bs-banner { padding: 120px 24px; background: url(\u0027https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?w=1600\u0026q=80\u0026auto=format\u0026fit=crop\u0027) center/cover no-repeat; position: relative; text-align: center; }\n  .bs-banner::before { content: \u0027\u0027; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(10,14,22,0.83); }\n  .bs-banner-inner { position: relative; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .bs-banner-quote { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 48px); font-weight: 800; color: #fff; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n  .bs-banner-quote span { color: #c4a050; }\n  .bs-banner-cite { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(196,160,80,0.7); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n\n  /* PHONE MOCKUP */\n  .bs-phone-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }\n  .bs-phone { width: 210px; background: #12121e; border-radius: 36px; padding: 10px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.35); box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }\n  .bs-phone-screen { background: #0d0d1a; border-radius: 27px; padding: 16px 14px; min-height: 320px; }\n  .bs-phone-label { font-size: 9px; color: #555; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .bs-phone-notif { background: rgba(196,160,80,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.25); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .bs-phone-notif-ico { font-size: 20px; }\n  .bs-phone-notif-lbl { font-size: 9px; color: #777; display: block; }\n  .bs-phone-notif-amt { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #c4a050; }\n  .bs-phone-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); font-size: 10px; }\n  .bs-phone-row span:first-child { color: #555; }\n  .bs-phone-pos { color: #4ade80; font-weight: 700; }\n  .bs-phone-total { margin-top: 12px; padding: 10px; background: rgba(196,160,80,0.07); border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 9px; color: #777; }\n  .bs-phone-total strong { display: block; font-size: 22px; color: #c4a050; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 2px; }\n\n  /* AFFILIATE */\n  .bs-affiliate {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #1a2235);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.2);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 64px 56px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 56px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .bs-affiliate h2 { margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .bs-affiliate p { color: #999; font-size: 16px; max-width: 520px; }\n  .bs-affiliate-cta { text-align: center; }\n  .bs-affiliate-note { font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 12px; }\n\n  /* YOUTUBE */\n  .bs-yt-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; }\n  .bs-yt-card {\n    background: #161d2a;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 40px 36px;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s;\n  }\n  .bs-yt-card:hover { border-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.3); }\n  .bs-yt-thumb { position: relative; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 24px; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }\n  .bs-yt-thumb img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.3s; }\n  .bs-yt-card:hover .bs-yt-thumb img { transform: scale(1.03); }\n  .bs-yt-play-btn { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: background 0.2s; }\n  .bs-yt-play-btn svg { filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)); }\n  .bs-yt-card:hover .bs-yt-play-btn { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }\n  .bs-yt-card h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .bs-yt-card p { font-size: 15px; color: #999; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n  /* KONTAKT */\n  .bs-contact-inner {\n    max-width: 640px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .bs-contact-inner h2 { margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .bs-contact-inner p { color: #999; font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 40px; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .bs-contact-email { color: #888; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px; display: block; }\n  .bs-contact-email a { color: #c4a050; text-decoration: none; }\n\n  /* FOOTER */\n  .bs-footer {\n    background: #0a0e16;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n    padding: 40px 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #555;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  .bs-footer a { color: #666; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 20px; }\n  .bs-footer a:hover { color: #c4a050; }\n\n  /* BLOG */\n  .bs-blog-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }\n  .bs-blog-card {\n    background: #161d2a;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;\n    display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .bs-blog-card:hover { border-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.3); transform: translateY(-3px); }\n  .bs-blog-tag { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c4a050; margin-bottom: 12px; display: block; }\n  .bs-blog-body { padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }\n  .bs-blog-body h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.4; }\n  .bs-blog-body p { font-size: 14px; color: #888; line-height: 1.7; flex: 1; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n  .bs-blog-link { font-size: 13px; color: #c4a050; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: gap 0.2s; }\n  .bs-blog-link:hover { gap: 10px; }\n  .bs-blog-accent { width: 100%; height: 4px; }\n\n  /* RESPONSIVE */\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .bs-nav-links { display: none; }\n    .bs-about-grid, .bs-pillars, .bs-funnel, .bs-programs, .bs-yt-grid, .bs-blog-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .bs-funnel::before { display: none; }\n    .bs-affiliate { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }\n    .bs-affiliate p { max-width: 100%; }\n    .bs-nav { padding: 12px 20px; }\n    .bs-nav-logo img { height: 60px; }\n    .bs-section { padding: 64px 20px; }\n    .bs-affiliate { padding: 40px 28px; }\n    .bs-footer { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }\n    .bs-footer a { margin: 0 10px; }\n  }\n\u003c/style\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"bs-page\"\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- NAV --\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"bs-nav-wrap\"\u003e\u003cnav class=\"bs-nav\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-nav-logo\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Logo-Badge-Neu.png\" alt=\"Business \u0026 Spirit\" style=\"height:80px;width:auto;display:block;\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cul class=\"bs-nav-links\"\u003e\n      \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"#ueber\"\u003eÜber mich\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n      \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"#programme\"\u003eProgramme\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n      \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"#partner\"\u003eNebeneinkommen\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n      \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"#youtube\"\u003eYouTube\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n      \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"#kontakt\"\u003eKontakt\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n      \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/terminbuchung/\" style=\"background:rgba(196,160,80,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.5);padding:8px 18px;border-radius:6px;\"\u003eTermin buchen\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n    \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \u003c/nav\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- HERO --\u003e\n  \u003csection class=\"bs-hero\" id=\"start\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-hero-dots\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-hero-grid\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-hero-inner\"\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"bs-hero-eyebrow\"\u003eBusiness \u0026amp; Spirit\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003ch1\u003eAndreas Stock\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBusiness. Spirit. Freiheit.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\n        \u003cp class=\"bs-hero-sub\"\u003eUnternehmerisches Denken trifft innere Klarheit. Für Männer, die nicht nur funktionieren wollen.\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-btn-group\"\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/standortcheck\" class=\"bs-btn-primary\"\u003eKostenlos starten\u003c/a\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"#programme\" class=\"bs-btn-secondary\"\u003eAlle Programme\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-hero-stats\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-hero-stat-num\"\u003e25+\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-hero-stat-label\"\u003eJahre Unternehmer\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-hero-stat-num\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-hero-stat-label\"\u003eBewährte Programme\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-hero-stat-num\"\u003e100%\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-hero-stat-label\"\u003eAlltagstauglich\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-hero-photo\"\u003e\n        \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Andi-Glatt.png\" alt=\"Andreas Stock\"\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/section\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- ÜBER MICH --\u003e\n  \u003csection class=\"bs-section\" id=\"ueber\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-section-inner\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-about-grid\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-about-text\"\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"bs-section-label\"\u003eÜber mich\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003ch2\u003eWer ich bin\u003c/h2\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003e25 Jahre als Unternehmer. Ich habe Firmen aufgebaut, Mitarbeiter geführt, Krisen durchgestanden. Ich weiß, was es bedeutet, wenn man morgens aufsteht und der Kopf schon läuft, bevor der erste Kaffee fertig ist.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003eIrgendwann merkte ich: Das Funktionieren hatte mich übernommen. Ich war produktiv, strukturiert, verantwortlich, aber innerlich taub. Kein echter Antrieb mehr. Nur noch Pflicht.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIch habe lange nach dem Fehler gesucht. Im Kalender. In der Strategie. Im nächsten Kurs.\u003c/strong\u003e Bis ich verstanden habe, dass der Fehler nicht im Außen lag.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003eDer Weg zurück hat mich durch viele Erkenntnisse geführt, aus der Neurowissenschaft, aus alten Weisheitstraditionen, aus schlichter Stille. Was mich heute trägt, ist kein System. Es ist Klarheit. Und die lässt sich lernen.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003eHeute kombiniere ich beides: digitales Business, das läuft, und die innere Arbeit, die dafür sorgt, dass du weißt, warum es läuft.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-about-tags\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-tag\"\u003e25+ Jahre Unternehmer\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-tag\"\u003eInnere Klarheit\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-tag\"\u003eDigitales Business\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-tag\"\u003eYouTube · 2 Kanäle\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;border:1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.2);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-about-quote\" style=\"border-radius:0;border-left:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.15);background:rgba(196,160,80,0.05);padding:32px 36px;\"\u003e\n            \u003cblockquote\u003e\"Keine Therapie. Keine Motivation. Kein Esoterik-Frame. Klare Prozesse. Alltagstaugliche Methoden. Würde und Respekt für das, was du aufgebaut hast.\"\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n            \u003ccite\u003e— Andreas Stock\u003c/cite\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Bild-5.png\" alt=\"Andreas Stock am Schreibtisch\" style=\"width:100%;height:300px;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;display:block;background:#0f1520;\"\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/section\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- BANNER --\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"bs-banner\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-banner-inner\"\u003e\n      \u003cp class=\"bs-banner-quote\"\u003eDie größte Veränderung\u003cbr\u003ebeginnt \u003cspan\u003einnen.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cspan class=\"bs-banner-cite\"\u003eAndreas Stock · Business \u0026amp; Spirit\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- DREI SÄULEN --\u003e\n  \u003csection class=\"bs-section bs-section-alt\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-section-inner\"\u003e\n      \u003cspan class=\"bs-section-label\"\u003eWas dich hier erwartet\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003ch2\u003eDrei Bereiche. Ein Ziel.\u003c/h2\u003e\n      \u003cp class=\"bs-section-intro\"\u003eInnere Stärke und äußerer Erfolg schließen sich nicht aus. Sie gehören zusammen.\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-pillars\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-pillar\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-pillar-icon\"\u003e\u003csvg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a050\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M9.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-4.96-.44 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 1-.34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.98-3A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 9.5 2Z\"/\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M14.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4.96-.44 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 0 .34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.98-3A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 14.5 2Z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003ch3\u003eMentale Klarheit\u003c/h3\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003eRaus aus dem Funktionsmodus. Zurück zu innerer Ruhe, klarem Fokus und echter Souveränität. Ohne Therapiesprache, ohne Dramatisierung.\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-pillar\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-pillar-icon\"\u003e\u003csvg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a050\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\u003cpolyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"/\u003e\u003cpolyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003ch3\u003eBusiness \u0026amp; Marketing\u003c/h3\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003eOnline-Marketing, digitale Automatisierung und smarte Systeme, die für dich arbeiten. Auch wenn du nicht da bist.\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-pillar\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-pillar-icon\"\u003e\u003csvg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a050\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\u003crect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003ch3\u003eDigitale Freiheit\u003c/h3\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003ePassive Einkommensmodelle, Affiliate-Programme und digitale Produkte, die echte zeitliche und finanzielle Unabhängigkeit ermöglichen.\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/section\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- DREIKLANG --\u003e\n  \u003csection class=\"bs-section\" id=\"neustart\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-section-inner\"\u003e\n      \u003cspan class=\"bs-section-label\"\u003eNeustart im Kopf\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003ch2\u003eDein Weg, Schritt für Schritt\u003c/h2\u003e\n      \u003cp class=\"bs-section-intro\"\u003eStarte kostenlos. Geh so tief, wie es für dich passt.\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-funnel\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-funnel-step\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-funnel-number\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"bs-funnel-badge\"\u003eKostenlos\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003ch3\u003eE-Book: Standortcheck\u003c/h3\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003eWo stehst du wirklich? Ein ehrlicher Blick auf deinen aktuellen Zustand. Kostenlos, direkt, ohne Umwege.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/standortcheck\" class=\"bs-btn-primary\"\u003eJetzt kostenlos holen\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-funnel-step\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-funnel-number\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"bs-funnel-badge\"\u003eMinikurs\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003ch3\u003eRaus aus dem Funktionsmodus\u003c/h3\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003e3 Module, 10 Lektionen. Ein gezielter Reset für deinen Kopf und dein Nervensystem. Alltagstauglich, sofort umsetzbar.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/raus-starten\" class=\"bs-btn-primary\"\u003eZum Minikurs\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-funnel-step\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-funnel-number\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"bs-funnel-badge\"\u003eHauptkurs\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003ch3\u003eNeustart im Kopf\u003c/h3\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003e9 Module, 51 Lektionen. Die vollständige Methode für nachhaltige innere Führung, damit du wieder der bist, der du mal warst. Nur klarer.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/neustart-kurs\" class=\"bs-btn-primary\"\u003eZum Hauptkurs\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/section\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- ALLE PROGRAMME --\u003e\n  \u003csection class=\"bs-section bs-section-alt\" id=\"programme\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-section-inner\"\u003e\n      \u003cspan class=\"bs-section-label\"\u003eAngebote\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003ch2\u003eAlle Programme auf einen Blick\u003c/h2\u003e\n      \u003cp class=\"bs-section-intro\"\u003eWähle, was jetzt für dich passt.\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-programs\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-card\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-cover\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Standortcheck.jpg\" alt=\"E-Book Standortcheck\"\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-body\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-program-badge bs-badge-free\"\u003eKostenlos\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eE-Book: Standortcheck\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eWo stehst du wirklich? Kostenlos, direkt, ohne Umwege.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/standortcheck\" class=\"bs-program-link\"\u003eKostenlos holen →\u003c/a\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-card\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-cover\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Raus-aus-dem-Funktionsmodus.jpg\" alt=\"Minikurs Raus aus dem Funktionsmodus\"\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-body\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-program-badge bs-badge-entry\"\u003eEinstieg\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eMinikurs: Raus aus dem Funktionsmodus\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003e3 Module, 10 Lektionen. Gezielter Reset für Kopf und Nervensystem.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/raus-starten\" class=\"bs-program-link\"\u003eMehr erfahren →\u003c/a\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-card featured\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-cover\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Neustart-im-Kopf-1.jpg\" alt=\"Neustart im Kopf Hauptkurs\"\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-body\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-program-badge bs-badge-top\"\u003eEmpfohlen\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eNeustart im Kopf (Hauptkurs)\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003e9 Module, 51 Lektionen. Die vollständige Methode für nachhaltige innere Führung.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/neustart-kurs\" class=\"bs-program-link\"\u003eMehr erfahren →\u003c/a\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-card\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-cover\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/simple-workspace-at-home-6476595.jpeg\" alt=\"TAC 3.0 Nebeneinkommen\"\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-body\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-program-badge bs-badge-partner\"\u003eDigitales Business\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eTAC 3.0: Nebeneinkommen aufbauen\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eFertig zum Kopieren. Ideal für 9-to-5 oder Rente aufbessern, kein Vorwissen nötig.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/tac-workshop\" class=\"bs-program-link\"\u003eMehr erfahren →\u003c/a\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-card coming-soon\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-cover bs-cover-innercode\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/InnerCode-Titelbild.png\" alt=\"InnerCode KI-Assistent\"\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-body\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-program-badge bs-badge-soon\"\u003eDemnächst\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eInnerCode KI-Assistent\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSpiritueller KI-Begleiter für innere Klarheit, basierend auf Tolle, Dispenza und anderen.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-coming-label\"\u003eDemnächst\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-card\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-cover\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Ebook-KI-Postingpaket.png\" alt=\"KI Postingpaket\"\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-program-body\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-program-badge bs-badge-free\"\u003eKostenlos starten\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eInstagram Autopilot System\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eGratis KI-Prompt-Paket als Einstieg. Sieh selbst, wie automatisierter Content funktioniert.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/ki-prompt-paket\" class=\"bs-program-link\"\u003eGratis Prompts holen →\u003c/a\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/section\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- AFFILIATE / PARTNER --\u003e\n  \u003csection class=\"bs-section\" id=\"partner\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-section-inner\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-affiliate\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"bs-section-label\"\u003eDigitales Nebeneinkommen\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003ch2\u003eRente aufbessern. 9-to-5 hinter sich lassen. Digital starten.\u003c/h2\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003eDu hast noch nie online Geld verdient, weißt nicht, wo du anfangen sollst? TAC 3.0 ist ein komplett fertiges System. Du kopierst es, bewirbst es und verdienst mit.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003cul class=\"bs-check-list\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003csvg class=\"bs-check-icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a050\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\u003cpolyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003eFertige Vorlagen, Funnels \u0026amp; Inhalte, nichts selbst erstellen\u003c/li\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003csvg class=\"bs-check-icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a050\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\u003cpolyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003eKein technisches Vorwissen. Kein eigenes Produkt.\u003c/li\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003csvg class=\"bs-check-icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a050\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\u003cpolyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e10–20 Minuten täglich, ideal neben Job oder Rente\u003c/li\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003csvg class=\"bs-check-icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a050\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\u003cpolyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003eProvision bei jeder Weiterempfehlung: 30–50%\u003c/li\u003e\n          \u003c/ul\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:28px;\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-phone-wrap\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"bs-phone\"\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"bs-phone-screen\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"bs-phone-label\"\u003eTAC 3.0 · Einnahmen\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"bs-phone-notif\"\u003e\n                  \u003cspan class=\"bs-phone-notif-ico\"\u003e💰\u003c/span\u003e\n                  \u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan class=\"bs-phone-notif-lbl\"\u003eNeue Provision eingegangen\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"bs-phone-notif-amt\"\u003e+127,00 €\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"bs-phone-row\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHeute\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"bs-phone-pos\"\u003e+254,00 €\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"bs-phone-row\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiese Woche\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"bs-phone-pos\"\u003e+1.143,00 €\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"bs-phone-row\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDieser Monat\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"bs-phone-pos\"\u003e+3.870,00 €\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"bs-phone-total\"\u003eGesamteinnahmen 2026\u003cstrong\u003e+18.240 €\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-affiliate-cta\"\u003e\n            \u003ca href=\"https://sicher-weiterlesen.com/tac-workshop\" class=\"bs-btn-primary\"\u003eKostenloser Workshop\u003c/a\u003e\n            \u003cp class=\"bs-affiliate-note\"\u003eSchreib \"INFO\" in die Kommentare\u003cbr\u003eauf meinen Social-Media-Posts\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/section\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- YOUTUBE --\u003e\n  \u003csection class=\"bs-section bs-section-alt\" id=\"youtube\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-section-inner\"\u003e\n      \u003cspan class=\"bs-section-label\"\u003eContent\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003ch2\u003eMeine YouTube-Kanäle\u003c/h2\u003e\n      \u003cp class=\"bs-section-intro\"\u003eTiefgründige Inhalte, die bewegen. Kostenlos auf YouTube.\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-yt-grid\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-yt-card\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-yt-thumb\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/YouTube_Thumbnail_InnerCode-30.png\" alt=\"InnerCode Video\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"bs-yt-play-btn\"\u003e\u003csvg width=\"52\" height=\"52\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.92)\"\u003e\u003cpolygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003ch3\u003eInnerCode\u003c/h3\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003eBewusstsein, Heilung, innere Ruhe. Tiefgründige Inhalte für Männer, die mehr wollen als nur Ratschläge.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://youtube.com/@innercode.projekt\" class=\"bs-btn-secondary\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eZum Kanal\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-yt-card\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-yt-thumb\"\u003e\n            \u003cimg src=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/YouTube_Thumbnail_Bewusst_Einfach-34.png\" alt=\"Bewusst Einfach Video\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"bs-yt-play-btn\"\u003e\u003csvg width=\"52\" height=\"52\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.92)\"\u003e\u003cpolygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003ch3\u003eBewusst Einfach\u003c/h3\u003e\n          \u003cp\u003ePsychologie, Gesellschaft, Emotion. Klare Antworten auf Fragen, die die meisten nicht stellen.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@bewussteinfach\" class=\"bs-btn-secondary\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eZum Kanal\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/section\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- KONTAKT --\u003e\n  \u003csection class=\"bs-section\" id=\"kontakt\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-section-inner\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-contact-inner\"\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"bs-section-label\"\u003eErstes Gespräch\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003ch2\u003eKlarheitsgespräch\u003c/h2\u003e\n        \u003cp\u003eKein Coaching-Pitch. Kein Verkaufsgespräch.\u003cbr\u003e30 Minuten, in denen wir ehrlich schauen, wo du stehst, und ob meine Arbeit das Richtige für dich ist.\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003cp style=\"font-size:15px;color:#777;margin-bottom:32px;margin-top:-24px;\"\u003eFür Männer, die spüren, dass sich etwas verändern muss, und die bereit sind, ehrlich hinzuschauen.\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003ca href=\"https://ansto-finaffairs.com/klarheitsgespraech/\" class=\"bs-btn-primary\"\u003eKostenlos Termin buchen\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"bs-contact-email\"\u003eLieber schreiben: \u003ca href=\"mailto:fin.affairs.anst@gmail.com\"\u003efin.affairs.anst@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/section\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- BLOG / GEDANKEN --\u003e\n  \u003csection class=\"bs-section bs-section-alt\" id=\"blog\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bs-section-inner\"\u003e\n      \u003cspan class=\"bs-section-label\"\u003eGedanken \u0026amp; Einblicke\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003ch2\u003eAus der Praxis, für die Praxis\u003c/h2\u003e\n      \u003cp class=\"bs-section-intro\"\u003eKeine Motivation. Keine Tipps von der Stange. Nur das, was ich selbst durchdacht und durchlebt habe.\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-grid\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-card\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-accent\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c4a050, rgba(196,160,80,0.2));\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-body\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-blog-tag\"\u003eInnere Arbeit\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eDer Funktionsmodus: warum er uns schützt und warum er uns leer macht\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eEs ist kein Versagen. Der Funktionsmodus war lange sinnvoll. Er hat dich durch Krisen getragen, durch Wachstumsphasen, durch schlaflose Nächte. Aber irgendwann kippt er, und du merkst es oft als letzter.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003ca href=\"#neustart\" class=\"bs-blog-link\"\u003eMehr dazu → Dein Weg raus\u003c/a\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-card\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-accent\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c4a050, rgba(196,160,80,0.2));\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-body\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-blog-tag\"\u003eBusiness \u0026amp; Klarheit\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eWarum bessere Strategie oft nicht die Antwort ist\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eMehr Struktur. Mehr Tools. Noch ein Kurs. Ich kenne das Muster, ich habe es selbst lange bedient. Das Problem war selten die Strategie. Es war der Kopf dahinter. Unruhig. Überladen. Nie wirklich frei.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003ca href=\"#ueber\" class=\"bs-blog-link\"\u003eMeine Geschichte lesen\u003c/a\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-card\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-accent\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c4a050, rgba(196,160,80,0.2));\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bs-blog-body\"\u003e\n            \u003cspan class=\"bs-blog-tag\"\u003eDigitale Freiheit\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003ePassives Einkommen: was das wirklich bedeutet und was nicht\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eDas Wort ist verbraucht. Aber das Konzept dahinter ist real. Es geht nicht darum, nichts zu tun. Es geht darum, Systeme zu bauen, die arbeiten, während du lebst. Das lässt sich lernen. Auch spät.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003ca href=\"#partner\" class=\"bs-blog-link\"\u003eWie das funktioniert →\u003c/a\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/section\u003e\n\n  \u003c!-- FOOTER --\u003e\n  \u003cfooter class=\"bs-footer\"\u003e\n    \u003cspan\u003e© 2026 Andreas Stock — ansto-finaffairs.com\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003cdiv\u003e\n      \u003ca href=\"/impressum/\"\u003eImpressum\u003c/a\u003e\n      \u003ca href=\"/datenschutzerklaerung/\"\u003eDatenschutz\u003c/a\u003e\n      \u003ca href=\"#kontakt\"\u003eKontakt\u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/footer\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- /wp:html --\u003e\n"}